    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849230/extras/0746a9ef0e11579ea29b6ece1095ce14.avif?t=1752979494\" width=800 height=209 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cheeky, randomly generated visual novel where Cherry\u2019s playful instructions keep you on your toes. Every play\u2019s a new tease\u201418+ only!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Cherry, a fiery redhead with a big personality. She and her sisters want to help you have lots of fun. Cherry loves wearing hot outfits like corsets and swimsuits, and sometimes even a tough leather suit. Cherry is waiting to be your guide and give you all sorts of\u00a0 things to do. Every time you play, you'll have a new adventure with her. Can you follow her directions? Don't miss out on the chance to play Cherry's JOI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849230/extras/62d24944039b16a931dac9a650c9568b.avif?t=1752979494\" width=800 height=209 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Player controlled events or give up control to Cherry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Encouragement or Humiliation modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 250+ unique images</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic moods that unlocks new instructions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Several JOI mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849230/extras/5987dbd9b33deb854eb1ce7d698f04fb.poster.avif?t=1752979494\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849230/extras/5987dbd9b33deb854eb1ce7d698f04fb.webm?t=1752979494\" type